<body lang=3D"EN-US" link=3D"blue" vlink=3D"purple">
<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Hello All,<o:p></o:p><=
/span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">This is an update to y=
ou on this matter to give perspective.&nbsp; At the end are some guidelines=
 on how to discuss this topic with customers when necessary.<o:p></o:p></sp=
an></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">As some of you are mor=
e aware than others, our molded sewer joints require higher insertion force=
s/effort than our competitors and has become a factor in sales.&nbsp; That =
our joint is tighter than our competitors
 is not a new development.&nbsp; That it has become a factor in growing sal=
es today is apparent and in some cases threatens current sales.&nbsp;
<i>Note this effort includes the spigots.<o:p></o:p></i></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">The program has these =
elements:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">1.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Characterize t=
he performance of our current design &#8220;at the extremes&#8221;.<o:p></o=
:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">2.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Characterize w=
hat is currently manufactured.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">3.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Identify the c=
hanges required to improve the ease of installation while meeting all other=
 needs.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">4.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Implement the =
changes.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">A parallel effort that=
 may allow some relief in the interim is:&nbsp;
<i>Not meant to take the place of the design upgrade.<o:p></o:p></i></span>=
</p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">5.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Research the p=
otential for different installation instructions that could improve the cus=
tomer experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">6.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Implement new =
installation instructions and videos if useful.&nbsp;
<i>There are tricks to installation that we have never broadly publicized i=
n a permanent form.&nbsp; As contractor staff transitions due to age, these=
 can be lost especially given upheaval of these firms in 2008.</i><o:p></o:=
p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Schedule: </span></=
u><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">&nbsp;<i>This will take several months.<o:p=
></o:p></i></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">The first thing we hav=
e done is identify and acquire the staff required to conduct what could be =
an extensive dimensional measurement campaign and to identify and acquire t=
he equipment needed to perform standardized
 installation force tests on our product and on our competitors.&nbsp; A ch=
ange to the design will be required assuming this continues to be confirmed=
 not to be QC problem.&nbsp; The change will be one or a combination of the=
 following.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">7.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Groove dimensi=
on changes<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">8.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Gasket dimensi=
on changes<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">9.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Gasket materia=
l changes<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Other points that will=
 factor in this effort are:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">10.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&=
nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">A looser joint=
 challenges the sealing capability at the other extreme of the tolerances<o=
:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">11.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&=
nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">And thus the i=
mpact this change will have on the reliability of seal of the product line.=
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l7 level=
1 lfo1"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">12.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&=
nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Reaction of cu=
stomers who value the tight joint for the confidence in sealing it gives th=
em<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">The quickest route to =
a change is an hypothetical adjustment to the gasket design.&nbsp; This wou=
ld require changes to our gasket molds or possibly new molds.&nbsp; There w=
ill be the issue of existing inventory that may
 or may not extend the time to commercialization depending on how we can ch=
oreograph the transition.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Conversations with =
customers:<o:p></o:p></span></u></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Conversations with cus=
tomers that speak to our efforts to optimize the design for insertion ease =
should not speak to a particular change such as groove dimensions or tolera=
nces.&nbsp;
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level=
1 lfo8"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">A.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">You need only =
remark that changes to the joint design that are effective in all respects =
will be implemented to respond to their concerns and make insertion forces =
acceptable.&nbsp;
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level=
1 lfo8"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">B.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">With respect t=
o schedule you can say that our best current estimate is that it will take =
a minimum of several months because of the tooling changes that are likely =
and resolution of current inventory.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level=
1 lfo8"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><span style=3D"m=
so-list:Ignore">C.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">Enlist contrac=
tors, distributors, and municipalities to test drive prototype samples to g=
et market feedback on potential solutions but not yet.<o:p></o:p></span></p=
>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">This is an open ended =
problem meaning we don&#8217;t know what we don&#8217;t know.&nbsp; As we g=
et into it we will learn more that will allow us to refine our understandin=
g of schedule.&nbsp; If it can be done quickly we will do
 it quickly.&nbsp; As schedule becomes more refined you will be informed.<o=
:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#1F497D">j<o:p></o:p></span></p=
>
</div>
</body>
